        "original_id": "b123f174-78ca-571b-a25b-3f06880bd1d2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Wain, Ödön von Horváth\n- Works: Young Shoulders\n- Groups: The Movement\n\nFacts:\n- Ödön von Horváth, born Edmund Josef von Horváth, was born on 9 December 1901 in Sušak, Rijeka, then in Austria–Hungary and now in Croatia.\n- Ödön von Horváth was a German-writing playwright and novelist of Austro-Hungarian birth.\n- John Barrington Wain was born on 14 March 1925 and was an English poet, novelist, and critic.\n- John Wain was associated with the literary group The Movement.\n- Young Shoulders is a 1982 novel by John Wain.\n- Ödön von Horváth died on 1 June 1938 in Paris.\n- John Wain died on 24 May 1994 and was appointed CBE.",
